description=Installs the ztMetro Action Centre as /system_ext/priv-app recents provider: static framework RRO config_recentsComponentName -> org.ztmetro.actioncentre/.RecentsActivity, the recents priv-app allowlist, and the overlay itself. Reboot required. The recents key/gesture still opens Launcher3QuickStep: WMShell is not patched. Remove the module and reboot to roll back.
